{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28313","headline":"春日言怀寄虢州李常侍十韵 · 杜牧","name":"春日言怀寄虢州李常侍十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岸藓生红药，岩泉涨碧塘。\n地分莲岳秀，草接鼎原芳。\n雨派潀漴急，风畦芷若香。\n织蓬眠舴艋，惊梦起鸳鸯。\n论吐开冰室，诗陈曝锦张。\n貂簪荆玉润，丹穴凤毛光。\n今日还珠守，何年执戟郎。\n且嫌游昼短，莫问积薪长。\n无计披清裁，唯持祝寿觞。\n愿公如卫武，百岁尚康强。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28313.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28313","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}